        <mxCell id="e_draft_ch" edge="1" parent="1" source="draft" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;" target="conf_head">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ch_sc" edge="1" parent="1" source="conf_head" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;" target="sched">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_sc_vf" edge="1" parent="1" source="sched" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;" target="verif">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_vf_em" edge="1" parent="1" source="verif" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;" target="emit">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_loop" edge="1" parent="1" source="emit" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="in_state">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="240" y="418" />
              <mxPoint x="240" y="978" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="loop_label" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#666666;" value="↺ next step" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="18" width="80" x="160" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="detail_reject" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDF2F2;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;shadow=0;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Lossless Rejection Sampling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• temperature=0: greedy verify (lossless)&lt;br&gt;• temperature&amp;gt;0: P(accept x&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; | x&lt;sub&gt;1..k-1&lt;/sub&gt; accepted) = min(1, p&lt;sup&gt;t&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;(x&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;)/p&lt;sup&gt;d&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;(x&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;))&lt;br&gt;• 首个拒绝位置 k → 丢弃 k+1..γ&lt;br&gt;• 残差采样 bonus token: p&lt;sub&gt;res&lt;/sub&gt; ∝ max(0, p&lt;sup&gt;t&lt;/sup&gt; - p&lt;sup&gt;d&lt;/sup&gt;) / ||·||&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="88" width="390" x="800" y="481" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_detail_reject" edge="1" parent="1" source="detail_reject" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#B85450;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="verif">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="detail_sched" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;shadow=0;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Hardware-Aware Scheduler&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 目标: max Θ = τ · SPS(B)&lt;br&gt;• τ = Σ&lt;sub&gt;r&lt;/sub&gt; Π&lt;sub&gt;j≤k&lt;/sub&gt; c&lt;sub&gt;r,j&lt;/sub&gt;（全局存活概率累积）&lt;br&gt;• B = 全局 top-B 预算，非初始 block 大小&lt;br&gt;• SPS(B): 离线预剖析的离散 SPS 表（以 CUDA-graph 预配置尺寸为索引，需插值）&lt;br&gt;• 实现 Algorithm 1，基于 smooth-SPS 假设贪心选择 L ≤ γ&lt;br&gt;• 异步：CPU sizing · GPU slot 分配 · ZOS（Zero-Overhead Scheduler） · 全局存活概率排序" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="390" x="800" y="586" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_detail_sched" edge="1" parent="1" source="detail_sched" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#D6B656;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="sched">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="detail_conf" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F0FA;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;shadow=0;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Confidence Head &amp; STS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• c&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; = σ(proj([h&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;; markov_embed&lt;sub&gt;k-1&lt;/sub&gt;]))&lt;br&gt;• markov_embed&lt;sub&gt;k-1&lt;/sub&gt; = W&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;[x&lt;sub&gt;k-1&lt;/sub&gt;]（可选拼接）&lt;br&gt;• 条件: P(draft k survives | prefix 1..k-1 accepted)&lt;br&gt;• STS 校准: left-to-right grid search&lt;br&gt;• 基于历史 accept 统计&lt;br&gt;• 输出 [B, γ]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="260" x="800" y="713" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_detail_conf" edge="1" parent="1" source="detail_conf" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9673A6;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="conf_head">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="detail_markov" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F5FA;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;shadow=0;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Markov Head 细节&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 并行主干输出 U&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; ∈ [B, γ, V]（含锚点；γ=5）&lt;br&gt;• Markov 头: B(x&lt;sub&gt;k-1&lt;/sub&gt;,·) = W&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;[x&lt;sub&gt;k-1&lt;/sub&gt;] W&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;, rank r=256&lt;br&gt;• 融合: p&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;(v) ∝ exp(U&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;(v) + B&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;(v))&lt;br&gt;• 从左到右顺序采样，条件于前一个实际采样 token&lt;br&gt;• 变体: Vanilla / Gated / RNN；Gated 为默认推荐" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="260" x="800" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="detail_loss" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F5FA;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;shadow=0;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Draft 训练目标&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• L = 0.1·L&lt;sub&gt;CE&lt;/sub&gt; + 0.9·L&lt;sub&gt;TV&lt;/sub&gt; + 1.0·L&lt;sub&gt;Conf&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;• L&lt;sub&gt;TV&lt;/sub&gt; = ||p&lt;sub&gt;draft&lt;/sub&gt; - p&lt;sub&gt;target&lt;/sub&gt;||&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;（接受率代理）&lt;br&gt;• L&lt;sub&gt;Conf&lt;/sub&gt;: 二元交叉熵&lt;br&gt;• 监督信号: accept_rate = 1 - d&lt;sub&gt;TV&lt;/sub&gt; = 1 - L&lt;sub&gt;TV&lt;/sub&gt;/2&lt;br&gt;• d&lt;sub&gt;TV&lt;/sub&gt; = 0.5·||p&lt;sub&gt;d&lt;/sub&gt; - p&lt;sub&gt;t&lt;/sub&gt;||&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 后训练阶段继续对齐，梯度不回传到 backbone" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="260" x="800" y="1023" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_detail_markov" edge="1" parent="1" source="detail_markov" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="draft">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
